cmiqzjsza0001gpi3iz6rzl8y	healthy-snacks-for-kids-in-nepal-parent-guide	Healthy Snacks for Kids in Nepal | Parent Guide	{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"As parents, we always worry about what our children eat. In today’s world of junk food, chips, and sugary snacks, finding a healthy snack for kids in Nepal can be a real challenge. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Luckily, one traditional grain is making a comeback — Kodo, also known as millet."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Arksh Food, a Nepali company focused on health and quality, has introduced a delicious and nutritious option for families: "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.daraz.com.np/products/arksh-food-dami-kodomillet-biscuit-family-pack-200gm-i185033448-s1223338443.html?spm=a2a0e.8553159.0.0.1b4c97e125zUBk&search=store","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}}],"text":"Kodo Biscuits."},{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"These biscuits are quickly becoming one of the best biscuits in Nepal for health-conscious parents."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What Are Kodo Biscuits?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://arkshgroup.com/blog/what-is-finger-millet-a-complete-guide-to-this-ancient-grain","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}}],"text":"Kodo"},{"type":"text","text":", or finger millet, is a traditional grain found in the hills of Nepal. For generations, it has been part of our local diet, which is used in oatmeal, dhido, and rotis. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"But now, Arkash Food has given a modern twist by converting this age grain into delicious cookies and biscuits."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"These Kodo biscuits in Nepal are made using natural ingredients, low sugar, and no maida (refined flour). They are high in fiber, full of nutrients, and most importantly, tasty enough that your kids will love them!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why are Kodo biscuits the best option for children? "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The top reasons why Kodo biscuits are quickly becoming a healthy snack for children are: "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. ✅ High nutritional value "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Kodo is rich in fiber, protein, calcium, and iron. These are nutrients essential for your child's physical and mental development. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Iron helps in the development of the brain and prevents weakness. "}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Calcium strengthens bones and teeth. "}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fiber improves digestion and prevents constipation. "}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is why these biscuits are not just snacks - they are nutritious snacks for the whole family."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. ✅ Low in Sugar – Great for Diet Control"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Children today are eating too many sweets and processed snacks. Arksh Food’s low-sugar cookies for diet plans are a great way to control sugar intake while still giving your child a treat."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"These sugar-free or low-sugar millet biscuits help reduce the risk of obesity and diabetes in the long run."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. ✅ Made from Local Nepali Ingredients"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Arksh Food uses locally grown millet, supporting Nepali farmers and promoting sustainable food choices."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"As parents, we feel more confident when our children eat something grown in our land."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Buying these biscuits means you’re not only giving your child healthy food but also supporting the local food economy."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. ✅ Perfect for School Lunch & Tea Time"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether it's early morning, snack break at school, or evening tea time, these Nepali snacks for tea time are light, easy to carry, and satisfying."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can pack them in your child’s lunchbox without worrying about artificial flavors or harmful preservatives."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"5. ✅ Trusted Nepali Brand with Quality Focus"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Arksh Food is becoming known as one of the top biscuit brands in Nepal for its focus on health, quality, and innovation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our Kodo biscuits and millet cookies have received love from both urban families and health lovers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What Other Millet Products Does Arksh Food Offer?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Apart from the classic Kodo biscuits, Arksh Food has expanded into other millet-based snacks and healthy biscuit options."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dami Millet Cookies"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"These best millet cookies in Nepal are slightly sweet, crunchy, and full of natural goodness."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sugar-Free Kodo Biscuits"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A favorite among diet-conscious parents, especially for diabetic or pre-diabetic family members."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Family Packs"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Available in bulk for homes, hostels, or gift hampers, making it easy to stock nutritious snacks for the family."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why Choose Millet Over Regular Maida Biscuits?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"justify"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs