cmqtdn0c9000rn10k4m4acibv	what-s-the-fastest-way-to-improve-your-mood	What's the Fastest Way to Improve Your Mood? 	{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Introduction"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"How can you get happier? People often resort to "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Coffee","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"coffee "},{"type":"text","text":"for a pick-me-up when they are not feeling well."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"We've all had the days. When you wake up in the morning, you feel tired. You are starting to think that your work is too much. You have no energy. You aren't motivated. Simple things are difficult to do."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"People in this kind of mood seek something that will help relieve their pain quickly. Others take a stroll. Some people listen to music. Communicate with their friends. They may stop working for a while."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The first thing anyone reaches for is a cup of "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"coffee"},{"type":"text","text":", especially around the world. They enjoy having coffee in the morning, in the afternoon, or before a meeting. People feel more energetic and focused after drinking coffee."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why is it that people love coffee so much? What do they believe it's doing to transform a day around?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Coffee Is More Than Something to Drink"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"People do not drink coffee due to thirst. They drink coffee as part of their daily routine. It's a habit they have that they do daily."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"There are times when people like to have coffee. They drink it before going to work. While they are studying, they drink it. They take it when they are on breaks from work. When traveling, they drink it. They take it when they are watching TV at home."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee offers people an opportunity to relax. It's an opportunity to sit and breathe and to slow down. It's not always the coffee that makes them feel better. It's the experience."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Does Coffee Make People Feel More Awake?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"It's due in part to "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.betterhealth.vic.gov.au/health/healthyliving/caffeine","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"caffeine"},{"type":"text","text":". Caffeine is a stimulant that is found in coffee. Promotes alertness and concentration."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee is a great drink to get people feeling more awake when they are tired. It can make them feel better or more ready for their jobs. That's why coffee is a part of our lives today."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee is a popular beverage that many people begin their day with. It assists them in waking up and being prepared for the day."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"The Afternoon Slump Is Real "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"We all get tired sometimes during the day. It is often after lunchtime for individuals in offices. For learners, it could be while they are studying. It may occur when you are traveling."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"In those moments, people seek to feel more focused; they seek to find something that will help them do that. Coffee is offered as an option, as it is easy to obtain and familiar."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A cup of joe can make people feel fresh. It can assist them in resuming their professional or educational endeavors with vigor."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Is Coffee Becoming More Popular in Nepal? "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tea was the main beverage in Nepal some time ago. Coffee was not so prevalent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"It's now different. The number of "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"coffee consumers in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" continues to be on the rise. Students bring their own coffee. Coffee is stored at the desks of office workers. Vacationers bring their coffee with them on vacation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"So there are reasons for this. Coffee is more accessible at this time. There are cafes. People's work habits are changing. They are busier. Looking for an energy boost."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Instant Coffee Is Popular in Nepal"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products/maccoffee-original-coffee-1gm-x-96-4-free-sachets","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Instant coffee"},{"type":"text","text":" is a popular beverage because it is an easy-to-make drink. It's easy and convenient. It can be made in minutes with water. Can be easily carried. The flavour remains unchanged. It is affordable."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"For people, instant coffee is a good choice. They don't have time to brew their own coffee. They require something simple."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Do People Think Coffee Can Improve Their Mood? "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"There are reasons. Coffee makes a habit. It provides people with a respite. It provides comfort. It makes people feel more concentrated."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee is a beverage that is more than just coffee to people. It is linked with experiences."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why More Consumers Are Choosing MacCoffee "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"With increased consumption of coffee comes the need for coffee drinks to be convenient and easily accessible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"It is here that "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?name=MacCoffee","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"MacCoffee"},{"type":"text","text":", which is available from "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Arksh Food"},{"type":"text","text":", is becoming a favourite among many coffee lovers in Nepal."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"MacCoffee is an option. Simple to make and can be used at any time of day. MacCoffee is popular because it's so easy to make."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Popular options available through "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Arksh Food"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"MacCoffee Gold"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"MacCoffee Original Coffee"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"MacCoffee Freeze-Dried Coffee"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"MacCoffee Original Cold Coffee"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A simple cup of coffee could be a part of your daily ritual."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Coffee Breaks Are About More Than Coffee"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"They provide opportunities for people to reflect. People don't often take time off today."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee break for relaxation and rejuvenation. It can assist them in structuring their thoughts and help them befriend their friends."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sometimes a short break can make a difference. Coffee offers people a break."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Coffee and Snacks Are a Popular Combination "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Many people will snack while drinking coffee. Biscuits, cookies, and puff snacks are popular snacks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee and snacks are enjoyed during breaks for many. At home in a state of relaxation. It's a way to take a break from a hectic day."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Many customers also love to combine "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"MacCoffee"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Biscuits,Cookies,Puffs","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"snacks"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Arksh Food"},{"type":"text","text":", which provide a quick and satisfying break during the day, whether you are working, going to the library, or traveling."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee and snacks are still a common choice for Nepalis wherever they have a break throughout the day – morning coffee, afternoon refreshments, or early evening break."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"The Future of Coffee in Nepal "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"While there are some positive aspects to coffee, it is best to enjoy it in moderation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coffee is most effective when part of a lifestyle that includes other healthy behaviors, such as sleep, exercise, and good nutrition. Coffee isn't a way of life, it's a way of living."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"When used responsibly, most people can have a cup of coffee every day without any problems."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Final Thought "}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The prospects are bright for the future of "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"coffee in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":". People want products that are convenient and of good quality, due to the changes in their lifestyle."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"tex