cmrlzsfc60000l40ksnbyuuis	tea-time-snacks-in-nepal-what-goes-best-with-your-daily-cup	Tea Time Snacks in Nepal: What Goes Best with Your Daily Cup?	{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Introduction"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tea in Nepal was never just a drink. Not really. It's the thing that gets a lot of us moving in the morning, the small pause office workers wait for by mid-afternoon, and somehow the reason families end up sitting together in the evening instead of scattering to different rooms. Take away the snack sitting next to that cup, though, and something about the whole break feels off."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The choices have opened up a lot compared to a decade ago. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Biscuits","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Biscuits "},{"type":"text","text":"are still around; obviously, they never really left. But now there are "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Cookies","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"cookies"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Puffs","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"puff snacks"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?name=Cracker","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"crackers"},{"type":"text","text":", and for anyone who'd rather skip tea altogether, a proper cup of "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Coffee","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"coffee "},{"type":"text","text":"too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"So which of these actually earns a spot next to your daily cup? Here's a look at the most popular "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"tea time snacks in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":", and what tends to make one worth reaching for over another."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Tea Time Is an Important Part of Nepali Culture"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tea shows up everywhere in daily life here, so much that it's easy to stop noticing it at all. Most mornings start with a warm cup before anyone heads out the door. Office workers wait on that afternoon break like it's the only thing standing between them and 5 pm. And come evening, tea becomes the excuse families use, "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"actually, to"},{"type":"text","text":" catch up after a long day apart."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"There's a social side to it too. Put a cup of tea in front of a guest, and you've already made them feel welcome, no extra effort required."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since tea comes up this often, deciding on "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"snacks in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" has turned into almost as big a decision as picking the tea itself."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What Makes a Great Tea-Time Snack?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Not everything belongs next to a cup of tea, and most people figure this out fast through trial and error. What tends to work: something light, a bit crispy, quick to eat, simple enough to put out when guests arrive without much planning, flavourful without being overwhelming, and priced in a way that doesn't make you think twice."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"tea time snacks"},{"type":"text","text":" tend to sit alongside the drink rather than compete with it. Sweet tooth or savoury preference, there's usually something that lines up with what you're craving that day."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Biscuits: Nepal's Favourite Tea-Time Companion"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragra