s and snacks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Are corn cookies healthy?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Corn cookies can be a better snack option when made with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"quality ingredients"},{"type":"text","text":" and enjoyed in moderation. Always check the ingredient list and nutrition label before purchasing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Can I eat corn every day?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Corn can be included regularly as part of a varied and balanced diet alongside fruits, vegetables, legumes, proteins, and other "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"whole grains"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"}]}]}	Discover the nutritional benefits of corn, locally known as Makai, and why it remains an important part of Nepali diets. Learn how corn supports energy, digestion, and balanced eating while fitting naturally into traditional meals and modern snacks.	https://minio-oks404ksgws8sc0wg8kcgok0.209.50.229.110.sslip.io/food/1785756978153-4166e720-ab31-4176-a728-89c0a7deeb56-Corn Benefits Why Makai Is One of Nepal's Most Nutritious Grains (2026 Guide).jpeg	Arksh Food	Corn Benefits: Why Makai Is a Nutritious Grain for Nepali Families	Discover the health benefits of corn (Makai), including fibre, energy, vitamins, minerals, antioxidants, and simple ways to include this traditional Nepali grain in everyday meals and snacks.	corn benefits, Makai benefits, corn nutrition, Makai nutrition, healthy grains Nepal, corn in Nepal, dietary fibre foods, glut