cmrkk38lq0010nn0k1qyxaxj6	snacks-in-nepal-the-ultimate-guide-to-choosing-better-everyday-snacks	Snacks in Nepal: The Ultimate Guide to Choosing Better Everyday Snacks	{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Introduction"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let's be honest, snacking has basically taken over daily life in "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" at this point. Rushing to work, sitting through a long lecture, stuck on a bus for hours, or just lounging at home in the evening, there's almost always something small being munched on in the background."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"But it's not just \\"grab whatever's closest\\" anymore. People are pickier now. They want something that tastes good, feels worth the price tag, and isn't made from a mystery list of ingredients."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nepal's snack shelves have changed a lot in the last few years, too. It used to be"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Biscuits","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}}],"text":" "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Biscuits","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"},{"type":"underline"}],"text":"biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", maybe a packet of something crunchy, and that was about it. Now you've got"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Puffs","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}}],"text":" "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Puffs","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"},{"type":"underline"}],"text":"puff snacks"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Cookies","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}}],"text":" "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Cookies","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"},{"type":"underline"}],"text":"cookies"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?name=crackers","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}}],"text":" "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?name=crackers","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"},{"type":"underline"}],"text":"crackers"},{"type":"text","text":", chocolates, "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"instant"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Coffee","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"}],"text":" "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Coffee","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"},{"type":"underline"}],"text":"coffee"},{"type":"text","text":", an entire aisle's worth of choices, honestly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"So what actually separates a \\"good\\" snack from just an okay one? And how do you even pick, with this many options staring back at you? That's what this guide gets into: "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"snacks in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":", the big categories worth knowing, and why old-school ingredients are suddenly back in fashion."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Snacking Has Become Part of Everyday Life"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nobody has time anymore; that's the short version. Students grab something between classes because a full meal just isn't happening. Office workers live for that tea break snack that gets them through the 3 pm slump. Families keep a stash at home, for guests, for kids after school, for that evening tea everyone somehow still finds time for. And travellers need something that survives a bumpy bus ride without turning to crumbs in the bag."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"For most people at this point, snacking isn't really a \\"sometimes\\" thing. It's just part of the day."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you had to describe what makes a snack worth keeping around, it'd probably come down to a handful of things: it's convenient, it doesn't cost a fortune, it actually tastes good, it's easy enough to carry, and it works whether you're at your desk or on a road trip. That's really the whole reason demand for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"snacks in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps going up year after year; it's not complicated."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What Makes a Good Everyday Snack?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the thing: not all snacks are created equal, and most people know it even if they can't quite explain why. Before buying, plenty of shoppers are weighing things like: is this fresh, does it actually taste good, is the packaging convenient, is this a brand I trust, and am I getting my money's worth here?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"And more people are flipping the packet over to check the label these days, especially if they're after something made with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"corn"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"oats"},{"type":"text","text":". At the end of the day, the snacks that stick around in someone's shopping basket are usually the ones that manage both: easy to grab and actually enjoyable to eat."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Popular Types of Snacks in Nepal"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nepal's snack market has gotten wide enough that there's genuinely something for almost every mood."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Biscuits"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Still the reigning favourite, honestly. Breakfast, tea breaks, office desk drawers, school lunch boxes, long trips, and "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" just fit everywhere."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A lot of people are now specifically hunting for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" made with traditional grains like "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo (Finger Millet)"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"corn"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Some of the popular picks:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo Biscuits"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Corn & Honey Biscuits"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Digestive Biscuits"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cookies"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cookies"},{"type":"text","text":" have found their own fan base, people who want something richer, thicker, a bit more indulgent than a plain biscuit. They go well with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"tea"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"coffee"},{"type":"text","text":", and for a lot of households, they've become the unofficial afternoon treat."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Even "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"cookies"},{"type":"text","text":" are catching on to the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"corn"},{"type":"text","text":" trend now, so there's more to choose from than there used to be."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Puff Snacks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Puff snacks"},{"type":"text","text":" are one of those things that never really go out of style. Kids love them, teenagers love them, and adults sneak a few too. That light, crunchy bite works for road trips, school bags, movie nights, family get-togethers, basically any evening where you want something to nibble on."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"And yes, "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"puff snacks"},{"type":"text","text":" now come in "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"corn"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"oat"},{"type":"text","text":" versions too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Crackers"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Crackers"},{"type":"text","text":" are the lighter option when "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"cookies"},{"type":"text","text":" feel like too much. Common at gatherings, and they pair nicely with a hot drink without being heavy."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Coffee and Beverage Companions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A snack break without something warm to sip on feels incomplete, doesn't it? "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Instant coffee"},{"type":"text","text":" has really taken off in "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" for exactly that reason. It's quick, no fuss, works at home, at the office, or while travelling."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pair it with a "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"cookie"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"cracker"},{"type":"text","text":", and suddenly you've got an actual break in your day, not just a bite in passing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Traditional Ingredients Are Making a Comeback"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's a shift worth noticing: traditional ingredients are having a moment again. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo (Finger Millet)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"corn"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"oats"},{"type":"text","text":", grains that have been around in Nepali farming for generations, are now turning up in modern, packaged snacks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"It says something about where things are headed. People still want the convenience of grabbing something off a shelf, but they'd rather that convenience come from ingredients they actually grew up eating, not something unfamiliar."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Healthy Snacking Is Becoming More Popular"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Health consciousness has quietly changed the way people shop. Taste still matters, a lot honestly, but it's no longer the only box people are checking. Fibre content, whole grains, whether something skips "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"maida"},{"type":"text","text":", clear ingredient labels, a manufacturer people actually trust, all of those factors are in now."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"That doesn't mean anyone's giving up their favourite snacks. It just means people are getting a little choosier about which version of that snack ends up in their bag."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Snacks for Every Occasion"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What keeps "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"snacks"},{"type":"text","text":" so popular, really, is how they fit into just about anything. Morning "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"tea"},{"type":"text","text":", office breaks, between classes, long journeys, family gatherings, movie nights, a light evening bite, festive celebrations, there's rarely a moment snacks don't fit into somewhere."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Having a mix of options on hand just means there's always something for whatever the moment calls for."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}