cmpxvfcfp009hns0kuqlwy2il	biscuits-vs-cookies-what-s-the-difference	Biscuits vs Cookies: What's the Difference?	{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No one in Nepal really thinks about this. Just buy it and eat it. However, if someone asked you to explain the difference between "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Biscuits","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"biscuits "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Cookies","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"cookies"},{"type":"text","text":", could you?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Most people simply can't, which is okay. Let's get sorted out anyway, though."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Use what you already know."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You've eaten both. When was the last time you ate a biscuit with tea? It was most likely crunchy and sweet, perhaps a little bland if you're being honest. You took a few bites, without even realizing it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now think about a cookie. Softer. Heavier. Some hot chocolate, oats, nuts, or something else. You were aware you were eating it. The difference, in so many words, is that awareness."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Biscuits don't demand your attention. Cookies do."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why are biscuits everywhere here"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nepal runs on tea. And tea apparently requires something to eat alongside it — this is just accepted as fact in most households. Biscuits filled that role because they were cheap, they lasted forever in a tin, and nobody complained about them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The ingredients are basic on purpose. Flour, oil, a bit of sugar, some flavoring. That keeps prices low. That's why you'll find them in tiny shops three hours from Kathmandu — they travel, they store, they're practical."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"There's also the multi-generational thing. Your grandmother ate Marie biscuits. Your parents ate "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://kwalitynepal.com/product/marie/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Marie biscuits."},{"type":"text","text":" You grew up eating them too. Habits like that don't break easily."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cookies are a different story."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"They started as imported things — stuff you'd see in the fancy aisle and not really consider buying. That's shifted a lot. Local options have gotten better, the variety has grown, and people are actually seeking them out now rather than just stumbling across them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/blog/best-cookies-in-nepal-ingredients-that-matter","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"best cookies in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" today include everything from oat-and-honey to dark chocolate to butter-loaded shortbread-style options. Real ingredients, not just flour and flavoring. Which is also why they cost more — butter and chocolate aren't cheap."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"But the bigger shift is in how people think about snacking. There's less \\"I just need something with tea\\" and more \\"I actually want to eat something good.\\""}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cookies fit the second mindset. Biscuits fit the first."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"The real differences"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Texture is the obvious one. Biscuits snap. Cookies give. If you handed someone a cookie and a biscuit blindfolded, they'd know instantly which was which just from how it felt in their hand."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sweetness is the other one. Biscuits are mild — you could eat them for breakfast and not feel like you'd had dessert. Cookies are genuinely sweet. Some are very sweet. That's not a criticism; it's just what they are."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Then there are ingredients. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Biscuits:"},{"type":"text","text":" flour, oil, a little sugar, done. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cookies:"},{"type":"text","text":" butter, eggs sometimes, chocolate, oats, dried fruit, nuts — whatever combination the recipe calls for. More going in means more flavor coming out, and also a higher price tag."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Picking between them"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the thing — "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"this isn't really a competition."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want something light for tea, something unobtrusive, something you can eat five of without feeling like you've committed to anything — biscuit. If you want something that's actually satisfying as a snack on its own, something with substance — cookie."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/blog/best-biscuits-in-nepal-2026-guide-healthy-tasty-affordable-picks","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"best biscuits in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" still hold their own for everyday snacking. Nobody's replacing them. But cookies have carved out their own space now, especially for people who want a bit more from what they're eating.'"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Both have a place. Different moments call for different things."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Cookies Have Become More Popular Recently"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A large part of it is about diversity. Take a look at a supermarket today, and you'll see cookies containing oats, chocolate, nuts, honey, dried fruits, and many other ingredients. There are just more choices than ever before."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The same thing can be seen at "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Arksh Food."},{"type":"text","text":" Instead of offering just one type of cookie, we focus on providing different options for different preferences. Some people enjoy lighter oat-based cookies, while others prefer richer flavours and textures."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Another reason is that people snack differently these days. Tea is still significant, of course. That's not going anywhere. However, more people are looking for snacks they can enjoy on their own rather than simply pairing them with a beverage."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's where cookies come in handy. Many biscuits evoke a tea break. A cookie can often feel like the snack itself."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Neither approach is better. They're just solving different problems."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"So, Which One Should You Buy?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Well, you're probably thinking too much about it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tea and biscuits are often the better choice if you're looking for an item to have around the house that anyone can reach for with tea."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you're in the mood for a snack, "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"cookies are an option when buying food."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Many people get stuck in the same position as most houses and have both."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The daily moments are dealt with by biscuits. When you're looking to have something a little more interesting, cookies are for you."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"That is why, it may be for this reason, there's never a resolution to the whole biscuits versus cookies debate. There are not many who are totally fixated on one or the other."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"They just choose what they feel is more appropriate for the day."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What Arksh Food thinks about this"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"We make "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Biscuits,Cookies","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"both"},{"type":"text","text":" — and we think that's the right call. Not everyone wants the same thing from a snack. Some people are loyal to a plain, crispy biscuit with their morning tea, and they're not changing. Others want to try something new, something richer. We'd rather have options for both than try to convince either group they're wrong."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Frequently Asked Questions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Is a biscuit equal to a cookie?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No. They are similar, but cookies tend to be sweeter and softer; biscuits tend to be crispier and lighter."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Biscuits or cookies, which are healthier?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"It depends on the ingredients and nutritional content. Some biscuits are not so sweet, and some cookies have healthier ingredients like oats."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What makes cookies more expensive?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Many cookies use more flavorful ingredients such as butter, chocolate chips, nuts, or oats, which add to their production costs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Is there a growing trend to eat cookies in Nepal?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. As people become more discerning and premium in their snack choices, demand for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"cookies in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" has increased."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Is it OK to eat a biscuit and a cookie every day?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, in moderation and as part of a well-balanced diet."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"}]}]}	Discover the real difference between biscuits and cookies, from texture and ingredients to taste and everyday use. Learn which option suits your snacking style and explore popular biscuits and cookies in Nepal.	https://minio-oks404ksgws8sc0wg8kcgok0.209.50.229.110.sslip.io/food/Biscuits vs cookies.png	Arksh Food	Biscuits vs Cookies: What's the Real Difference? (2026)	Confused about biscuits vs cookies? Learn the key differences in texture, ingredients, taste, and snacking habits while exploring popular options in Nepal.	biscuits vs cookies,cookies in nepal,biscuits in nepal,difference between biscuits and cookies,best cookies in nepal,best biscuits in nepal,cookies vs biscuits,nepal snacks,cookie ingredients,biscuit ingredients	2026-06-03 09:35:36.36	2026-08-07 13:53:38.098	\N	t	37
