to cut down on sugar intake."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"But honestly, "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"“sugar-free” alone shouldn’t be the only thing someone checks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sometimes products reduce sugar but compensate heavily with processed ingredients or artificial flavoring. So it’s still important to look at the overall ingredient quality instead of focusing on one label."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Balanced products usually make more sense than extreme ones."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Fibre Matters in Snacks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fibre is one of those things people ignore until they actually compare how different snacks feel afterward."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Some biscuits leave you hungry again after twenty minutes. Others feel more satisfied and stable."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"That’s where fibre helps."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Biscuits made with oats, millet, or whole grains generally feel more filling compared to heavily processed, refined snacks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type"