cmrro13830006qz0jeppw6c03	nepali-biscuits-a-complete-guide-to-nepal-s-favorite-biscuits-in-2026	Nepali Biscuits: A Complete Guide to Nepal's Favorite Biscuits in 2026	{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ask almost anyone in Nepal what they'd want with their morning tea, and "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?categoryNames=Biscuits","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"biscuits "},{"type":"text","text":"come up before anything else. They've been part of daily life here for so long that most of us don't even think twice about reaching for one. A "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuit in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" isn't just something sweet to nibble on; it's tied to"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":" "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"tea breaks, school lunches, guests arriving at the door,"},{"type":"text","text":" and those quiet evenings when the whole family sits together before dinner."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide takes a proper look at "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Nepali biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", where they came from, the different types people actually buy, how "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"millet and wheat biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" compare, and what makes a biscuit good for kids versus something more suited to a health-conscious shopper. By the end, you should have a clear picture of what's out there and how to pick the right one for your own tea time."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"History of Nepali Biscuits"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Biscuits weren't always the everyday item they are now. Decades ago, most households in Nepal relied on homemade snacks, things baked or fried at home using whatever grains were available locally. Wheat flour was common, but so were "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"millet and corn"},{"type":"text","text":", depending on the region and what grew well there."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"As packaged food began to enter Nepali markets, biscuits became one of the first snacks people trusted enough to buy regularly rather than make from scratch. They were affordable, they lasted a long time on the shelf, and they fit easily into a tea break without any preparation. Over the years, local manufacturers started producing "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuits in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" that catered specifically to Nepali tastes, moving beyond the plain imported varieties that used to dominate shop shelves."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Today, the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuit market in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" looks completely different from what it was even fifteen years ago. There's far more variety, better ingredients, and a growing number of brands that lean into "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"traditional grains"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than moving away from them. In a lot of ways, the story of the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Nepali biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":" is really the story of how Nepal's food habits evolved without losing touch with what people always liked eating."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Popular Biscuit Types in Nepal"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Walk into any grocery store in Nepal today, and you'll find a fairly wide spread of "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuit types"},{"type":"text","text":", each serving a slightly different purpose depending on the moment."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Digestive biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" remain a household staple, mostly because they pair so naturally with a cup of tea and tend to sit lighter than sweeter options. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cream biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" are usually the ones kids gravitate toward, thanks to the added sweetness and fun textures. Then there are the more traditional "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"grain-based biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", ones made with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo or corn"},{"type":"text","text":", which have picked up a lot of attention recently as people look for something a bit more rooted in local ingredients."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Some of the more recognisable names among "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Nepali biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" today include "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?name=Kodo%2FMIllet","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Kodo Biscuits"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":", "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?name=Corn%20%26%20Honey","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Corn & Honey Biscuits"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":", and "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/products?name=Digestive","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Digestive Biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", each offering something a little different depending on what someone's actually in the mood for. It's this range that makes it easy to say there really is "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"a biscuit for every kind of tea break in Nepal."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/blog/what-makes-millet-snacks-different-from-regular-wheat-based-biscuits","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Millet vs Wheat Biscuits"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is probably one of the more common questions people have when shopping for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuits in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" these days. Should you go with a traditional "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"wheat biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":", or reach for something made with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"millet"},{"type":"text","text":" instead?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wheat biscuits have been around the longest and tend to have a familiar, mild flavour that most people grew up with. They're versatile, work well with almost any tea, and are usually a bit more budget-friendly too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Millet biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", particularly those made with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo"},{"type":"text","text":", have become popular for different reasons. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo is naturally higher in fibre"},{"type":"text","text":", and because it's a grain that's been part of Nepali agriculture for generations, it carries a certain nostalgic appeal alongside its nutritional value. The taste is a little earthier compared to wheat, and a lot of people find that flavour genuinely enjoyable rather than something they're settling for."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Neither option is really better across the board; it comes down to what someone's looking for. If it's a familiar, everyday biscuit, wheat still does the job well. If it's about eating something a bit more nutritious while still getting that biscuit experience, "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"millet-based options like Kodo Biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" tend to win out."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/blog/tea-time-snacks-in-nepal-what-goes-best-with-your-daily-cup","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Tea Biscuits"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tea and biscuits are practically inseparable in Nepal, so it's worth talking about what actually makes a "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"good tea biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":" specifically."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The best "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"tea biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" tend to be light, not overly sweet, and sturdy enough to survive a quick dunk without falling apart in the cup. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Digestive biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" fit this description well, and that's part of why they've remained so popular over the years. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Corn & Honey Biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" also work nicely here, offering a slightly sweeter edge without overwhelming the tea itself."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether it's a quiet cup at home or tea served to guests who've just arrived, having "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"a reliable tea biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":" on hand tends to make the whole moment feel a bit more complete."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kids Biscuits"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/blog/best-snack-choices-for-children-during-school-hours","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Biscuits for kids"},{"type":"text","text":" need to check a slightly different set of boxes than what adults look for. Taste obviously matters a lot here; kids aren't going to eat something just because it's healthy. But increasingly, "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"parents in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" are also paying attention to what's actually in the biscuit their child is eating every day."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is where biscuits made with familiar grains like "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"corn or Kodo"},{"type":"text","text":" start to make more sense for families. They tend to offer better nutritional value than heavily processed cream biscuits, while still being sweet enough that kids genuinely enjoy them. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Corn & Honey Biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", in particular, tend to work well here, striking a decent balance between a treat kids actually want and something a parent doesn't mind handing over regularly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Packaging matters too. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Smaller, easy-to-carry packs"},{"type":"text","text":" tend to work better for school lunch boxes and quick snacks between activities, something worth keeping in mind when shopping for kids specifically."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Healthy Biscuits"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Health-conscious shoppers have become a much bigger part of the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"biscuit market in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" than they used to be. Instead of grabbing whatever's on the shelf, more people are checking ingredient labels, looking for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"fibre content"},{"type":"text","text":", and steering away from biscuits loaded with refined flour and excess sugar."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Millet-based biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" tend to come up a lot in this conversation, mainly because "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo naturally brings higher fibre content"},{"type":"text","text":" along with a grain that's been part of Nepali diets for a long time already. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Digestive biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" also get picked frequently by people after something a bit lighter and less processed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"None of this means people are giving up biscuits altogether, not even close. It just means the definition of a "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"\\"good\\" biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":" has shifted a little; taste is still non-negotiable, but ingredients and nutrition now factor into the decision in a way they didn't as much before."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Arksh Food's Biscuit Range"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Arksh Food has built its biscuit lineup around exactly this shift, combining familiar, traditional ingredients with the kind of everyday convenience Nepali households actually want."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo Biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":" brings finger millet into a ready-to-eat format, giving fibre-conscious shoppers something they can reach for without giving up on taste. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Corn & Honey Biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":" leans into that classic Makai flavour Nepal has always loved, with a touch of sweetness that works well for both kids and adults. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Digestive Biscuit"},{"type":"text","text":" rounds out the range with a lighter, everyday option built for regular tea time use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Together, these make up a fairly complete answer to what most people are actually looking for when they shop for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/blog/healthy-biscuits-in-nepal-what-actually-matters-before-buying","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"biscuits in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"something familiar, something reasonably healthy, and something that just works with a daily cup of tea."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Final Thought"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Biscuits have earned their place as one of Nepal's most reliable everyday snacks"},{"type":"text","text":", and that's not likely to change anytime soon. What has changed is the variety available and the ingredients going into them, with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"traditional grains like Kodo and corn"},{"type":"text","text":" making a genuine comeback alongside the wheat biscuits people have always known."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether you're after "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/blog/best-biscuits-in-nepal-2026-guide-healthy-tasty-affordable-picks","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"best biscuits in Nepal"},{"type":"text","text":" for a family tea time, something specifically suited for kids, or a healthier option that still delivers on taste, there's more choice today than ever before. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Brands like "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.arkshfood.com/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":"text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline cursor-pointer"}},{"type":"bold"},{"type":"italic"}],"text":"Arksh Food"},{"type":"text","text":" are helping keep that variety growing, staying rooted in familiar Nepali ingredients while meeting the convenience modern life actually demands."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Frequently Asked Questions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What are the most popular biscuits in Nepal?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Digestive biscuits, cream biscuits, and grain-based options like Kodo Biscuits and Corn & Honey Biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" are among the most widely enjoyed biscuits in Nepal today."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Are millet biscuits healthier than wheat biscuits?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Millet biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", particularly those made with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Kodo"},{"type":"text","text":", tend to offer higher fibre content compared to standard wheat biscuits, making them a popular choice for people looking for a slightly healthier everyday option."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What biscuits are best for kids?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Biscuits made with familiar ingredients like "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"corn"},{"type":"text","text":", such as "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Corn & Honey Biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":", tend to work well for kids since they offer decent nutrition alongside a taste children actually enjoy."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Which biscuit brands are popular in Nepal?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nepal's biscuit market includes several local and national brands, with "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Arksh Food"},{"type":"text","text":" gaining attention for combining traditional ingredients with modern, ready-to-eat formats."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Where can I buy Nepali biscuits?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Nepali biscuits"},{"type":"text","text":" are widely available at supermarkets, grocery stores, convenience stores, and specialty food shops across the country."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}}]}	Discover the complete guide to Nepali biscuits, from their history and evolution to the most popular varieties available today. Compare millet and wheat biscuits, explore healthy options for families and children, and learn why traditional ingredients like Kodo and corn are making a comeback. Find the perfect biscuit for tea time, school lunches, and everyday snacking with Arksh Food's range of nutritious and delicious biscuits.	https://minio-oks404ksgws8sc0wg8kcgok0.209.50.229.110.sslip.io/food/1784457681429-998fdcf2-0c2a-41ad-b253-d0c133964408-Nepali Biscuits A Complete Guide to Nepal's Favorite Biscuits in 2026.jpg	Arksh Food	Nepali Biscuits Guide: Choosing the Best Biscuits in Nepal	Explore the ultimate guide to Nepali biscuits. Learn about Kodo, digestive, wheat, and corn biscuits, their benefits, and how to choose the best biscuits in Nepal for every occasion.	Nepali biscuits, biscuits in Nepal, best biscuits in Nepal, Kodo biscuits, digestive biscuits Nepal, corn biscuits Nepal, wheat biscuits, millet biscuits Nepal, healthy biscuits Nepal, tea biscuits Nepal, kids biscuits Nepal, Arksh Food biscuits, finger millet biscuits, tea time snacks Nepal, Nepali snack brands, traditional biscuits Nepal, family biscuits Nepal, everyday biscuits	2026-07-19 10:41:21.543	2026-08-11 09:20:29.492	\N	t	22
